## 📌 SOFTWARE ENGINEERING REQUIREMENT — WEEK 4

### UML Class Diagram — Model Architecture

The diagram shows the relationship between user inputs, configuration, checkpoints, model components, and output.

```mermaid
classDiagram
    class User {
        +selectImage()
        +selectVideo()
        +selectModel()
        +generateAnimation()
    }

    class SourceImage {
        +imageData
        +resize()
    }

    class DrivingVideo {
        +videoData
        +fps
        +frames
    }

    class Configuration {
        +modelName
        +imageSize
    }

    class Checkpoint {
        +filename
        +modelWeights
    }

    class KeypointDetector {
        +detectKeypoints()
        +trackMotion()
    }

    class Generator {
        +generateFrame()
    }

    class AnimationEngine {
        +makeAnimation()
        +applyMotion()
    }

    class OutputVideo {
        +frames
        +fps
        +save()
    }

    User --> SourceImage
    User --> DrivingVideo
    User --> Configuration
    Configuration --> Checkpoint
    Checkpoint --> KeypointDetector
    Checkpoint --> Generator
    SourceImage --> AnimationEngine
    DrivingVideo --> AnimationEngine
    KeypointDetector --> AnimationEngine
    Generator --> AnimationEngine
    AnimationEngine --> OutputVideo
```